# Education Slice (E1–E4)

Use when finishing weekly classes, the free attendant cap, Hetzner SMTP, or Privacy/Terms + platform reset.

## Behavior

- Read `agents/knowledge/education-slice.md` before changing EA or auth.
- Local first for E1/E2/E4. Deploy only if the user asked or `EDUCATION_DEPLOY=true`.
- Cap must be enforced in EA on appointment create, not only on the Next.js dashboard.
- Platform forgot-password is Next.js `cp_users` only — do not reuse EA `Recovery.php` sessions.

## Do not

- `php index.php console install` on a tenant with bookings
- Rsync local `tenants/` or `thesibook-email-config.php` to Hetzner
- Leave footer legal links as `#`
- Print SMTP passwords
